{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_YDb4VRxiyQyl1t2VVMulQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:20.245993+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_YDb4VRxiyQyl1t2VVMulQ","html":"<div><p><span><span>按照学校接收</span><span><span>2027</span></span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生有关要求，结合学院实际，特制定我院</span><span><span>2027</span></span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（简称推免生）工作方案及安排如下。</span></span></p><p><span><b><span><span>一、招生专业及拟接收推免生人数</span></span></b></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span>专业代码</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>专业名称</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（如区分招生方向可按招生方向填写）</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>拟接收硕士生人数</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>030500</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>马克思主义理论</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>30</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><span>注：拟接收推免生人数可根据生源情况和学院实际适当调整。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>二</span></span></span><span><b><span><span>、申请要求及流程</span></span></b></span></p><p><span><span><span>申请基本条件</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>）中华人民共和国公民。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>）身体健康状况符合国家和学校规定的体检要求。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>）获得目前就读学校教育部推荐免试攻读研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生，或其他符合国家规定的免初试攻读硕士研究生资格人员。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>申请方式及材料提交</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>）申请材料要求：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>①《</span><span><span>2027</span></span><span>年接收免试攻读研究生报名表》</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份（报名系统导出）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>②本科成绩单</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>③个人简历</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>④《电子科技大学研究生招生考生诚信复试承诺书》（见附件）</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份</span><span><span>,</span></span><span>本人签字。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>⑤身份证复印件</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>⑥学生证复印件</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>备注：</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>12:00</span></span></span><span><span><span>前登录</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>电子科技大学研究生招生管理信息系统</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>https://yzbm.uestc.edu.cn/logon</span></span></span><span><span><span>）通过</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>全国优秀本科生遴选计划</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>模块进行信息登记，并在系统中提交</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请材料要求</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>中的电子版材料（须将所有材料按所列顺序合并成一个</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span><span><span>文档上传），逾期不再受理。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>）申请方式：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span><span><span>9</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>12:00</span></span><span>前登录“电子科技大学研究生招生管理信息系统”（</span><span><span>https://yzbm.uestc.edu.cn/logon</span></span><span>）通过“全国优秀本科生遴选计划”模块进行信息登记，并提交相关申请材料。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span><span>学院审核申请人的材料，结合报名情况、专业契合度、既往学业科研表现等择优确定复试名单，并在学院网站公布。未入选者不再另行通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>）入选复试名单</span></span></span><span><span><span>的学生请加入“成电马院推免</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span></span><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span><span><span>群（群号：</span></span></span><span><span><span>2159012876</span></span></span><span><span><span>，申请入群请注明</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请专业名称</span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span><span>本科院校名称</span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span><span>学生姓名</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>，加入后请修改群名片，并查看群公告和群文件）。入选复试的学生因故不能参加复试的，请及时告知相关老师。</span></span></span></p><p><span><b><span><span>三、</span></span></b></span><span><b><span><span>复试考核</span></span></b></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>、学院审核申请人的材料并确定复试名单，符合条件的申请人必须通过</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>中国研究生招生信息网</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/</span></span></span><span><span><span>）“推免服务系统”报名，并按时完成复试相关确认工作。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>、复试时间相关安排：</span></span></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>事项</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>时</span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>间</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>说</span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>明</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>学校报名系统、材料提交</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>12:00</span></span><span>前</span></span></p></td><td><section><span><br/></span></section></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>公布复试名单</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span><span><span>9</span></span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><section><span><br/></span></section></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>复试</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span><span><span>12</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>9:30</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>（</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>）复试采用线下方式举行；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>）考生携带身份证、准考证、复试通知单；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>）复试采取“三随机”原则，具体考场、复试顺序等在</span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span>群内通知。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>公布复试结果</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span><span><span>14</span></span><span>日</span></span></p></td><td><section><span><br/></span></section></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>国家“推免服务系统”填报</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>符合条件的申请人，必须在</span><span><span>9</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>21</span></span><span>日在 “全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”报名并按时完成相关确认工作，网址</span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span> </span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>、复试主要内容及要求</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>复试内容：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>）外语测试：包含但不限于英语口语、听力、阅读、翻译等形式。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>）综合测试：包含专业素质和能力、综合素质和能力等方面的考察。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>外语测试满分</span></span></span><span><span><span>100</span></span></span><span><span><span>分，综合测试满分</span></span></span><span><span><span>200</span></span></span><span><span><span>分，复试各项成绩按四舍五入取整数。考生复试成绩总分须达到满分</span></span></span><span><span><span>60%</span></span></span><span><span><span>视为复试合格，否则不予录取。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>复试流程：</span></span></span><span><span><span>每个考生面试时间一般不少于</span></span></span><span><span><span>20</span></span></span><span><span><span>分钟。①考生</span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>分钟自我介绍（建议英语），可包含本人学习、科研、社会实践或实际工作表现等。②“外语”测试，包含复试小组专家与考生英语交流、复试小组专家英语提问、现场翻译等多种形式。时长约</span></span></span><span><span><span>2-5</span></span></span><span><span><span>分钟。③“综合”测试，专家组根据专业知识、考生个人简历、本科成绩单、奖励及成果等材料，提出专业相关问题。时长约</span></span></span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span><span><span><span>分钟。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>复试要求：复试满分</span><span><span>300</span></span><span>分，其中英语测试满分</span><span><span>100</span></span><span>分，综合面试满分</span><span><span>200</span></span><span>分，复试各项成绩按四舍五入取整数，按复试总分从高到低择优录取。考生复试成绩总分须达到</span><span><span>180</span></span><span>分，否则复试不合格。复试成绩不合格者不予录取。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>注：根据申请情况，学院可能会组织多批次的复试。具体信息请关注学院网站公告或学院后续通知。</span></span></span></p><p><span><b><span><span>四、</span></span></b></span><span><b><span><span> </span></span></b></span><span><b><span><span>录取</span></span></b></span></p><p><span><span><span>学院通过国家“推免服务系统”向符合拟录取条件的申请人发送待录取通知。收到待录取通知的所有考生必须按时登录“推免服务系统”确认同意待录取，否则不得拟录取。</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请人同意接受我校待录取通知后，学校均不再取消拟录取。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>拟录取结果由学校研究生招生办公室审核后公示（网址：</span></span></span><span><span><span>yz.uestc.edu.cn</span></span></span><span><span><span>）。拟录取类型、专业等信息以公示信息为准。拟录取考生经公示后上报教育部录检合格方能确定为正式录取。</span></span></span></p><p><span><b><span><span>五、</span></span></b></span><span><b><span><span> </span></span></b></span><span><b><span><span>联系方式</span></span></b></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系人：李老师、马老师</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>61830573</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>61830572</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span><span><span>mksxytm@163.com</span></span></span></p><p><span><b><span><span>六、</span></span></b></span><span><b><span><span> </span></span></b></span><span><b><span><span>其他</span></span></b></span></p><p><span><span><span>拟录取名单确定后，考生须向录取学院提交本人思想政治和品德情况的现实表现材料</span></span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span><span><span><span>提交方式另行通知</span></span></span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span><span><span><span>。考生现实表现材料需由考生本人档案或工作所在单位的人事、政工部门加盖印章。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>体检安排在拟录取名单确定后另行通知。拟录取为非定向的考生必须在入学前（以学校当年开学报到时间为准）将个人档案调入学院（调档函正式录取后发放）。拟录取为定向的考生必须与学校、用人单位分别签订定向协议（合同）书（强军计划除外）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>监督与投诉方式：电话（</span></span></span><span><span><span>028-61831659</span></span></span><span><span><span>）；邮箱（</span></span></span><span><span><span>390955484@qq.com</span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本通知由马克思主义学院负责解释。其他未尽事宜按照教育部要求和学校关于</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span>年接收推免生工作有关规定执行。</span></span></span></p><p><span></span><span><span><span>马克思主义学院</span></span></span></p><p><span></span><span></span><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span></span><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span></span><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span></span><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span></span><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span></span><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span></span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span><span><span><span> 2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span><span><span>9</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>日</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"1d531ae28037d214e146c48fac7080cb96146a46d1f1f61ef8fa83a61677efa6","textLength":2253,"sourceSha256":"702f974d860f11b7a06939d2847cddd17e92181a156538c1efd0f15bc1e1498c","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-712605e8c5d0d15740e9","title":"2026年电子科技大学马克思主义学院关于2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作安排通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:20.245993+00:00"}
